<title>USA: Kimberly, Wis. won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings.</title>
<headline>Kimberly, Wis. won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings said it won $2.55 million of Kimberly, Wis., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series 1997A, with a true interest cost of 5.32 percent.</p>
